        {
          "post_id": "472488",
          "text": "<p>Simplify the boolean function $F(A, B, C, D)=\\Sigma(0,2,3,5,7,8,10,11,13,15)$</p><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>$F=A D+B^{\\prime} C+A B^{\\prime} D$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$F=A C+B^{\\prime} D+A B^{\\prime} C$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$F=B D+B^{\\prime}D^{\\prime}+CD$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>$F=B C+A^{\\prime} D+A^{\\prime} B^{\\prime} C$</li></ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "A",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "subject": "Digital Logic",
          "day": "Day 14"
        },
        {
